Clean-room TTS codec and sampling components:
  Copyright 2026 ModelCloud.ai. Apache-2.0.
  The following components are independent Apache-2.0 implementations
  written by ModelCloud.ai from a behavioral specification, without
  reference to any third-party implementation of them. They are compatible
  with the state_dict layout of the published MiniCPM-o 2.6 checkpoints.
    tts_26.py: ConvNeXtBlock, GFSQ, DVAEDecoder, DVAE,
      CustomRepetitionPenaltyLogitsProcessorRepeat, gen_logits,
      ConditionalChatTTS.generate, ConditionalChatTTS.decode_to_mel_specs,
      ConditionalChatTTS._init_weights
    modeling_minicpmo.py: gen_logits (the 4.5 repetition processor is the
      one defined in tts_26.py)

Transformers / SigLIP / Whisper / Encodec:
  Copyright 2024 Google AI and The HuggingFace Team. All rights reserved.
  Apache-2.0. Original copied-from notices remain in the relevant source.
  The NaViT SigLIP implementation additionally identifies
  HuggingFaceM4/siglip-so400m-14-980-flash-attn2-navit.
  Runtime decoder classes are imported from installed Transformers 5,
  rather than copied from an unrelated MiniCPM-V architecture.

The vector-quantize-pytorch FSQ implementation is an installed dependency,
not vendored code. Its upstream MIT attribution is Copyright (c) 2020
Phil Wang.

Model weights:
  No trained tensor payload is included. The published MiniCPM-o
  checkpoints (OpenBMB), including their TTS/DVAE weights, and any
  StepAudio2/BigVGAN neural-codec assets are distributed separately by
  their owners under their own terms.
